  {
    "id": "sitl21-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl21-tab",
    "name": "Float32 param echo on ArduPilot and PX4",
    "info": "ArduPilot path sets LOIT_SPEED_MS=10 as MAV_PARAM_TYPE_REAL32, echo-confirms, then reads it back (Copter 4.7.0 SITL has no WPNAV_SPEED).\n\nPX4 path sets MPC_XY_VEL_MAX=12 as MAV_PARAM_TYPE_REAL32, echo-confirms, then reads it back.\n\nConnections mirror SITL 04: AP bind 0.0.0.0:14550 -> 127.0.0.1:14551 sysid 1; PX4 bind 0.0.0.0:14560 -> 127.0.0.1:14561 sysid 11.",
    "x": 270,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
